HST Office: the Slides transitions gallery in the Transitions tab.

The gallery (control and .uno:HstApplyTransition from hst-slides-transition-gallery.patch, its vi strings
from hst-slides-transition-gallery-strings.patch) goes first in the "Chuyển tiếp đến trang chiếu này"
group, before the transition sidebar button, as Office shows its transition gallery.

- sd notebookbar.ui; solenv simpress.suppr: the gallery's tool item takes its accessible name from its
  command.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
---
--- a/sd/uiconfig/simpress/ui/notebookbar.ui
+++ b/sd/uiconfig/simpress/ui/notebookbar.ui
@@ -6499,6 +6499,17 @@
                             <property name="show-arrow">False</property>
                             <property name="icon_size">3</property>
                             <child>
+                              <object class="GtkToolButton" id="btnHstTransitionGallery">
+                                <property name="visible">True</property>
+                                <property name="can-focus">False</property>
+                                <property name="action-name">.uno:HstApplyTransition</property>
+                              </object>
+                              <packing>
+                                <property name="expand">True</property>
+                                <property name="homogeneous">True</property>
+                              </packing>
+                            </child>
+                            <child>
                               <object class="GtkToolButton" id="btnHstSlideChangeWindow6">
                                 <property name="visible">True</property>
                                 <property name="can-focus">False</property>
--- a/solenv/sanitizers/ui/modules/simpress.suppr
+++ b/solenv/sanitizers/ui/modules/simpress.suppr
@@ -716,3 +716,4 @@
 sd/uiconfig/simpress/ui/notebookbar.ui://GtkToolButton[@id='btnHstCtxChartDataRows'] button-no-label
 sd/uiconfig/simpress/ui/notebookbar.ui://GtkToolButton[@id='btnHstCtxChartResetAll'] button-no-label
 sd/uiconfig/simpress/ui/notebookbar.ui://GtkToolButton[@id='btnHstCtxChartResetPoint'] button-no-label
